Corrected message:

Stop the swap-colors shortcut from adding to recent colors

Pressing X (Swap primary and secondary colors) went through the
color setters that record recent colors, so each swap pushed colors
onto the recent-colors list. Swapping now leaves that list alone, as
the swap buttons already did.

Also:
- The swap and reset buttons in the main window, color picker panel
  and status-bar palette share one swap/reset implementation.
- Three copies of the color picker dialog open/run/close code are
  merged into one helper.
